{"id":1431,"slug":"intentions-of-murder","title":"Intentions of Murder","year":1964,"country":"Japan","duration":150,"spine":474,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/1431-intentions-of-murder","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/657702e01ca689b19768581b747e97e9/lBbqkEWi0j71pgETSpwoMhEHQH5J5l_large.jpg","description":"Sadako (Masumi Harukawa), cursed by generations before her and neglected by her common-law husband, falls prey to a brutal home intruder. But rather than become a victim, she forges a path to her own awakening. This disturbing and pitiless evocation of domestic drudgery and sexual violence is also a fascinating, unsentimental account of one woman’s determination. Filled with director Shohei Imamura’s characteristic flashbacks and dream sequences, Intentions of Murder is a gripping, audacious portrait of a woman coming into her own in a man’s world. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Shohei Imamura","slug":"shohei-imamura"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Masumi Harukawa","role":"Sadako Takahashi","slug":"masumi-harukawa"},{"actor":"Kô Nishimura","role":"Riichi Takahashi","slug":"ko-nishimura-2"},{"actor":"Shigeru Tsuyuguchi","role":"Hiraoka","slug":"shigeru-tsuyuguchi"},{"actor":"Yûko Kusunoki","role":"Yoshiko Masuda","slug":"yuko-kusunoki"},{"actor":"Ranko Akagi","role":"Tadae Takahashi","slug":"ranko-akagi"},{"actor":"Yasuo Itoga","role":"Eiji Tamura","slug":"yasuo-itoga"},{"actor":"Yoshi Kato","role":"Seizo Takahashi","slug":"yoshi-kato"},{"actor":"Tanie Kitabayashi","role":"Kinu Takahashi","slug":"tanie-kitabayashi"},{"actor":"Kazuo Kitamura","role":"Seiichiro Takahashi","slug":"kazuo-kitamura"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Shohei Imamura","slug":"shohei-imamura"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Keiji Hasabe","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Shohei Imamura","slug":"shohei-imamura"},{"role":"Based on a story by","person":"Shinji Fujiwara","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Mutsuo Tanji","slug":nul